# Novel Writing Workspace - Git Ignore

# OpenCode skill configurations and progress tracking
.opencode/

# Compiled e-books (generated files)
**/exports/*.epub
**/exports/*.mobi
**/exports/*.azw3
**/exports/*.pdf

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# OS-specific files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-*

# Backup files
*.backup
*.old

# Local-only notes (optional - remove if you want to commit these)
local-notes.md
personal-todo.md

# Large assets that shouldn't be in git (optional)
# Uncomment if you have large image/audio files
# **/assets/*.mp3
# **/assets/*.wav
# **/assets/*.mp4
